    text: "Affected routes:\r\nDASH\r\n\nAffected stops:\r\nW Pine St & Tyler Ave (#21644) (eastbound)\r\nW Pine St & Hoover Ave (#21645) (eastbound)\r\nPine St & Johnson Ave (#21646) (eastbound)\r\nPine St & Grant Ave (#21647) (eastbound)\r\nMain St & Spruce St (#17881) (eastbound)\r\nPine St & Jefferson Ave (#21650) (westbound)\r\nPine St & Johnson Ave (#21651) (westbound)\r\nW Pine St & Hoover Ave (#21652) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound DASH get on/off buses at:\r\nW Pine St & S Polk Ave (#21643)\r\nPine St & Grant Ave (#21647)\r\n\nFor westbound DASH get on/off buses at:\r\nMain St & Short St (#17902)\r\nW Pine St & Tyler Ave (#21653)"
    language: "en"
  }
}
